# Before the Morning
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
Tomorrow feels very close.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
We do not have to solve it tonight.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
I know. Tonight, tell me something ordinary.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
The rosemary needs a larger pot.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then that is our first plan.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
Beyond the window, the road waits. Inside, there is still time for one more cup of tea.
